  "description": "After 100 years, the immortal archmage, Saul, returns to the valley where he once raised the little dragon, Hale. But the weak fledgling in Saul’s memory is now gone, replaced by a powerful, mad tyrant who is out for revenge. Hale refuses to be abandoned by Saul a second time, swearing to make the mage his mate for all of eternity. \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)\n\n*Note: Part of Luscent's X-mul Danpyeonseon (X물 단편선) Collection.*",
